{"id":"119-sres-852","label":"S.Res. 852","congress":119,"title":"A resolution requesting information on Israel's human rights practices pursuant to section 502B(c) of the Foreign Assistance Act of 1961.","latestVote":"2026-09-29","rollIds":["Senate:2:252"],"hasMetadata":true,"chambers":["Senate"],"congressUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/senate-resolution/852","metadataUrl":"https://www.govinfo.gov/bulkdata/BILLSTATUS/119/sres/BILLSTATUS-119sres852.xml","metadata":{"title":"A resolution requesting information on Israel's human rights practices pursuant to section 502B(c) of the Foreign Assistance Act of 1961.","introduced":"2026-09-14","latestAction":"Motion to discharge Senate Committee on Foreign Relations rejected by Yea-Nay Vote. 47 - 51. Record Vote Number: 252. (consideration: CR S5158-5159)","latestActionDate":"2026-09-29","policyArea":"International Affairs","subjects":[],"sponsors":["Sen. Van Hollen, Chris [D-MD]"],"cosponsors":["Sen. Kaine, Tim [D-VA]","Sen. Sanders, Bernard [I-VT]","Sen. Markey, Edward J. [D-MA]","Sen. Merkley, Jeff [D-OR]","Sen. Welch, Peter [D-VT]","Sen. Heinrich, Martin [D-NM]","Sen. Warren, Elizabeth [D-MA]","Sen. Hirono, Mazie K. [D-HI]","Sen. Smith, Tina [D-MN]","Sen. Luján, Ben Ray [D-NM]","Sen. Blumenthal, Richard [D-CT]","Sen. Wyden, Ron [D-OR]","Sen. Schatz, Brian [D-HI]","Sen. Murphy, Christopher [D-CT]","Sen. Coons, Christopher A. [D-DE]","Sen. Durbin, Richard J. [D-IL]","Sen. Blunt Rochester, Lisa [D-DE]","Sen. Shaheen, Jeanne [D-NH]","Sen. Murray, Patty [D-WA]","Sen. Reed, Jack [D-RI]","Sen. Whitehouse, Sheldon [D-RI]","Sen. Duckworth, Tammy [D-IL]","Sen. Kim, Andy [D-NJ]","Sen. Baldwin, Tammy [D-WI]","Sen. Warnock, Raphael G. [D-GA]"],"committees":["Foreign Relations Committee"],"laws":[],"committeeReports":[],"costEstimates":[],"relatedBills":[],"textVersions":[{"date":"2026-09-14","stage":"Introduced in Senate","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/BILLS-119sres852is/xml/BILLS-119sres852is.xml"}],"summaries":[{"date":"2026-09-14","stage":"Introduced in Senate","text":"This resolution requests that the Department of State provide Congress with an unclassified statement regarding Israel's human rights practices.\n\nThe resolution specifies that the statement should include certain elements, including (1) all credible information concerning the alleged killing of nine specified U.S. citizens and any other U.S. citizens by the Israeli Defense Forces, Israeli security forces, or Israeli settlers in 2022 or later; (2) all credible information concerning the identities of potential suspects in the killings; and (3) details on any steps taken by Israeli authorities to investigate the killings and hold accountable those responsible.\n\nThe statement should also include other elements, such as assessments of U.S. citizens currently held in Israeli prisons and the human rights situation of Palestinian children in Israeli military detention in the West Bank."}],"actions":[{"date":"2026-09-29","text":"Motion to discharge Senate Committee on Foreign Relations rejected by Yea-Nay Vote. 47 - 51. Record Vote Number: 252. (consideration: CR S5158-5159)"},{"date":"2026-09-29","text":"Motion to discharge Senate Committee on Foreign Relations made. (Pursuant to the Foreign Assistance Act of 1961)."},{"date":"2026-09-14","text":"Referred to the Committee on Foreign Relations. (text: CR S4675-4677)"},{"date":"2026-09-14","text":"Submitted in Senate"}]},"votes":[{"chamber":"Senate","congress":119,"session":2,"roll":252,"date":"2026-09-29","time":"06:32 PM","question":"On the Motion to Discharge S.Res. 852","description":"Motion to Discharge S. Res. 852","result":"Motion to Discharge Rejected (47-51)","amendment":"","amendmentDetail":"","tieBreaker":"","url":"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1192/vote_119_2_00252.htm","xmlUrl":"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1192/vote_119_2_00252.xml","counts":{"yes":47,"no":51,"present":0,"notVot